(7637746, 1239273, 24454, '<td valign="top">I think this is such a beautiful image!  My heart flutters over art with fog that enhances the drama of a beautiful scene.</td>', 'I think this is such a beautiful image!  My heart flutters over art with fog that enhances the drama of a beautiful scene.', '2019-08-10 13:41:23.000000', NULL, 1),
