(7638226, 1239627, 135744, '<td valign="top">The birds are the cherry on the cake - well done!</td>', 'The birds are the cherry on the cake - well done!', '2019-08-16 07:43:04.000000', NULL, 0),
(7638227, 1239689, 173844, '<td valign="top">Yes, here is minimalism.  Without the frills and splashes of color that make images exciting, yet then drift from the point.  Here''s where the excitement is born of concentrated simplicity.  So lovely as it is.</td>', 'Yes, here is minimalism.  Without the frills and splashes of color that make images exciting, yet then drift from the point.  Here''s where the excitement is born of concentrated simplicity.  So lovely as it is.', '2019-08-16 08:37:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(7638228, 1239465, 109227, '<td valign="top">This was my Blue winner;  esutiful, as always, Mark.</td>', 'This was my Blue winner;  esutiful, as always, Mark.', '2019-08-16 08:53:32.000000', NULL, 0),
(7638229, 1239692, 173844, '<td valign="top">True minimalism.  I hadn''t time (because I frittered it all away) to comment on the many images I really liked, but I was looking forward to commenting on yours.  Aside from the lovely colors, composition and line of the curving fence, what stood out for me are the closely spaced lines that add up to a study in texture.  As such, we''re now seeing an abstract as well as realism, and the two flutter back and forth, as well as mingle, in a most satisfying way.  These lines remind me of the striations left behind by over-passing ice sheets and glaciers.  So much to see in this fine image.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2019-08-16 09:17:01.</i></td>', 'True minimalism.  I hadn''t time (because I frittered it all away) to comment on the many images I really liked, but I was looking forward to commenting on yours.  Aside from the lovely colors, composition and line of the curving fence, what stood out for me are the closely spaced lines that add up to a study in texture.  As such, we''re now seeing an abstract as well as realism, and the two flutter back and forth, as well as mingle, in a most satisfying way.  These lines remind me of the striations left behind by over-passing ice sheets and glaciers.  So much to see in this fine image.', '2019-08-16 08:53:39.000000', '2019-08-16 10:17:01.000000', 0),
(7638231, 1239635, 173844, '<td valign="top">Truly fine, beautiful, sensual and serene.</td>', 'Truly fine, beautiful, sensual and serene.', '2019-08-16 08:57:34.000000', NULL, 0),
(7638232, 1239641, 173844, '<td valign="top">Flamboyant modesty.  It''s when a seemingly ordinary scene actually bursts with life and beauty, to be appreciated by an open heart and wise vision.  An overflow of emotion and sincerity.  Wonderful title.  And everything else.<br/>Sorry to have gypped you with a seven.</td>', 'Flamboyant modesty.  It''s when a seemingly ordinary scene actually bursts with life and beauty, to be appreciated by an open heart and wise vision.  An overflow of emotion and sincerity.  Wonderful title.  And everything else.Sorry to have gypped you with a seven.', '2019-08-16 09:07:53.000000', NULL, 0),
