(7638305, 1239686, 149964, '<td valign="top">Ah. Early morning start to get to Dorset with Sara and Wendy. Came across this field so pulled over to see what we could find amongst the already harvested field. Sara lost her glasses. Wendy found them. -  which was pretty amazing given the size of the area we had covered! As we got got back to the car we were quizzed by chaps who looked after the land - I guess they had to check we werent up to any mischief! There are some protected birds in the area  - happy enough to think someone was checking up on them.</td>', 'Ah. Early morning start to get to Dorset with Sara and Wendy. Came across this field so pulled over to see what we could find amongst the already harvested field. Sara lost her glasses. Wendy found them. -  which was pretty amazing given the size of the area we had covered! As we got got back to the car we were quizzed by chaps who looked after the land - I guess they had to check we werent up to any mischief! There are some protected birds in the area  - happy enough to think someone was checking up on them.', '2019-08-16 17:37:32.000000', NULL, 0),
